<h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
<div class="rd-panel">
    <p>RaceDay stores the details you give us (name, email, gender, optional phone number and profile picture) so you can enrol in events and see your results.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Passwords are hashed by the RaceDay API and are never stored in plain text.</p>
